  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Livelihoods, Resilient Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a component of Cordaid&apos;s &#x201c;Resilient Community Action Plans&#x201d; (RCAP). The RCAP process aims to support the community and all stakeholders in developing a plan to strengthen a community&#x2019;s capacity to survive and bounce back from future disaster events, and mitigate and prevent hazard impact on community lives, livelihoods and assets. The objective of the project is to address the immediate social and economic needs of vulnerable populations within the communities, while improving the community&#x2019;s ability to address and reduce future risks and vulnerabilities; and to increase the communities&#x2019; adaptive capacity and ability to respond quickly and effectively to new emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
